# Route: guide 11 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 32 to 34, 27
# quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Wetlands, Ironforge, Ashenvale): Dun Modr -> Whelgar's Excavation Site
# -> Angerfang Encampment -> Direforge Hill -> Dun Modr -> Raptor Ridge ->
# Thelgen Rock -> Angerfang Encampment -> Whelgar's Excavation Site ->
# Menethil Harbor -> Dun Modr -> Menethil Harbor -> Dun Modr -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Dark Iron War (303; Dark Iron
# Dwarf 27-28, Dark Iron Tunneler 29-30, Dark Iron Saboteur 28-29, Dark Iron
# Demolitionist 30-31); A Grim Task (304; Balgaras the Foul 34).
